{
"voice": "af_heart",
"duration": 52.959,
"lines": [
{
"id": "hook",
"start": 0.5,
"end": 3.561,
"text": "Need more local clients? They're closer than you think."
},
{
"id": "maya",
"start": 4.161,
"end": 11.694,
"text": "Meet Maya. She runs a small web design studio. Finding new clients used to mean hours of searching, and guessing who to call."
},
{
"id": "search",
"start": 12.294,
"end": 20.027,
"text": "Now she opens Rothme's Lead Map. She types her city, sets her service radius, picks a business type, and finds leads in the area."
},
{
"id": "pins",
"start": 20.527,
"end": 27.131,
"text": "Real local businesses drop onto the map. Each one gets a Rothme Opportunity Score. Hot, warm, or cold."
},
{
"id": "why",
"start": 27.631,
"end": 35.166,
"text": "And it tells her why. No website listed. No reviews yet. Light competition. A clear, specific service to offer."
},
{
"id": "save",
"start": 35.766,
"end": 42.944,
"text": "She saves the best ones to her pipeline, adds an estimated job value, and sets a follow-up reminder on her calendar."
},
{
"id": "stages",
"start": 43.444,
"end": 46.342,
"text": "From new, to contacted, to bid submitted, to won."
},
{
"id": "cta",
"start": 47.042,
"end": 52.459,
"text": "Rothme Lead Map. Free for every account. Find your next client, at Rothme dot app."
}
],
